{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56334","headline":"对雪联语 · 尚隆之　吴永素","name":"对雪联语","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麪堆金井，谁堆汤饼。\n（尚隆之。\n）玉满天山，难刻佩环。\n（吴永素。\n见冯贽《云仙杂记》卷五《姑臧记》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚隆之　吴永素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}